<http://example.org/zoo#> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://example.org/zoo#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Zoo ontology"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2026.2" .
<http://example.org/zoo#Animal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Animal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Animal"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#Animal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "动物"@zh .
<http://example.org/zoo#Mammal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Mammal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/zoo#Animal> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Mammal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mammal"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#Mammal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "哺乳动物"@zh .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/zoo#Mammal> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:restriction .
_:restriction <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
_:restriction <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://example.org/zoo#eats> .
_:restriction <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://example.org/zoo#Fish> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Domestic cat"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "家猫"@zh .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chat"@fr .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Kitty"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Felis catus" .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "猫"@zh .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://example.org/zoo#legs> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://example.org/zoo#weightKg> "4.6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://example.org/zoo#lifespan> "15.0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://example.org/zoo#population> "700000000000000000000"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://example.org/zoo#domestic> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://example.org/zoo#code> "A-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Cat> <http://example.org/zoo#hasPart> _:tail .
_:tail <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tail"@en .
_:tail <http://example.org/zoo#lengthM> "0.35"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Kitten> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Kitten> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Kitten"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#Kitten> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Kitten> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0100001> <http://example.org/zoo#Cat> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Fish> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Fish> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fish"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#Fish> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鱼"@zh .
<http://example.org/zoo#Dog> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Dog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://example.org/zoo#Mammal> .
<http://example.org/zoo#Dog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dog"@en .
<http://example.org/zoo#Dog> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "狗"@zh .
<http://example.org/zoo#eats> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://example.org/zoo#eats> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "eats"@en .
